 class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 4 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/tried-cadcraft-free-open-source-autocad/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">我試咗：免費開源嘅 AutoCAD 平替 CADCraft</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">2026 年 10 月 29 日 · AI 新聞</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum has-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">📐 我試咗：免費開源嘅 AutoCAD 平替 CADCraft，叫我個 AI agent 照我標準畫咗兩張圖 上星期講 VectorCraft 嗰陣，我話網上有非官方網站列出 CAD 版本，我未證實到。</p><p class=\"zh hx-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">圖層、筆寬、字、符號都跟我標準；我負責定標準同睇結果。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/tried-cadcraft-free-open-source-autocad/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">閱讀全文</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-lab\" data-i=\"4\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-lab\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></span><b>T11</b><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 5 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"../lab/uk-site-analysis/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">UK Site Analysis</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">Site analysis diagrams · England</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">Pick a site anywhere in England, or draw its boundary, and get fourteen site analysis diagrams at one frame and scale: LiDAR building heights, sun and shadows, sunlight hours, planning constraints, flood zones, road and rail noise and a BRE 25° screening, plus a 3D exploded view and DXF/SVG in British National Grid. English only.</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"../lab/uk-site-analysis/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">開啟工具</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 6 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/hong-kong-project-first-homework-usually/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">做香港 project，第一份功課通常係 site analysis</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">2026 年 10 月 28 日 · AI 新聞</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum has-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">🗺️ 做香港 project，第一份功課通常係 site analysis。我整咗個免費工具：揀個香港地盤，出十二幅分析圖，仲可以喺 3D 入面將佢哋拆開嚟睇。</p><p class=\"zh hx-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">要打嘅折：個人興趣項目，唔係官方資料，唔可以代替測量或者專業意見。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/hong-kong-project-first-homework-usually/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">閱讀全文</span> &rarr;</a></p></div>", "rows": "<li class=\"k-journal\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"journal/tried-cadcraft-free-open-source-autocad/\" data-go=\"3\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-rt\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">我試咗：免費開源嘅 AutoCAD 平替 CADCraft</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">10月29日</span></span></a></li><li class=\"k-lab\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"../lab/uk-site-analysis/\" data-go=\"4\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-rt\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">UK Site Analysis</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">10月29日</span></span></a></li><li class=\"k-journal\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"journal/hong-kong-project-first-homework-usually/\" data-go=\"5\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-rt\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">做香港 project，第一份功課通常係 site analysis</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">10月28日</span></span></a></li>"}}